        "accession_number": "0001555280-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-12",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Historically, a substantial portion of our products and revenue has been the result of product lifecycle innovation where we actively work to broaden the value of existing products by developing new claims, extending to additional species, developing more convenient formulations, modifications and combinations, and by expanding usage into more countries.",
